    "q-89272": {
      "dom_id": "step-q89272",
      "name": "Question 16",
      "problem": "Which expression is equivalent to $(P∧M)∨Q?$",
      "worked_solution": "By the commutative law, $P∧M≡M∧P.$\n\nTherefore, $(P∧M)∨Q≡(M∧P)∨Q.$\n\nFinally, by the commutative law, we have\n\n$$\n(M∧P)∨Q≡Q∨(M∧P).\n$$",
      "calculator_instructions": "",
      "fields": [
        {
          "key": "selection",
          "type": "radio",
