    "q-83015": {
      "dom_id": "step-q83015",
      "name": "Question 20",
      "problem": "Which expression is equivalent to $X∨(Y∧Z)?$",
      "worked_solution": "By the commutative law, $Y∧Z≡Z∧Y.$\n\nTherefore, $X∨(Y∧Z)≡X∨(Z∧Y).$",
